WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.190
In the Mahabharata, a queen gives
birth to a hard mass of flesh.

2
00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:10.360
It is divided into pots of ghee,
and from it a hundred sons grow.

3
00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:16.400
In another sacred story, an unborn child is
moved from one mother's womb to another's.

4
00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:20.790
Today, IVF joins egg and
sperm in a laboratory.

5
00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:25.230
So do these ancient stories
help Hindus judge IVF?

6
00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:29.610
In this mission, you'll find out why
having children matters so much in Hindu

7
00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:30.730
tradition.

8
00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:35.530
Then you'll compare two scholars who build
Hindu ethics for new medicine in different

9
00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:36.640
ways.

10
00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:42.030
Your mission: find out whether these
ancient stories help Hindus judge IVF.
